1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,301
Ren: If you hear screaming above you,
don't go up.

2
00:00:02,971 --> 00:00:06,239
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
one of ten: hour zero.

3
00:00:06,559 --> 00:00:10,456
Ren: Job fourteen. Six rats. Easy money.

4
00:00:11,126 --> 00:00:13,935
Ren: Screaming. Above me. Rats don't
scream.

5
00:00:14,605 --> 00:00:16,822
Ren: Listen first. Look second.

6
00:00:17,492 --> 00:00:18,227
Ren: One.

7
00:00:19,092 --> 00:00:19,667
Ren: Two.

8
00:00:20,692 --> 00:00:21,262
Ren: Three.

9
00:00:22,292 --> 00:00:24,852
Ren: Three moves. That is all anyone
needs.

10
00:00:25,522 --> 00:00:28,651
Ren: Cache opened? Nobody can open that
but me.

11
00:00:29,321 --> 00:00:32,693
Ren: Seventy-two hours. Two hundred forty
kilometres.

12
00:00:33,363 --> 00:00:35,748
Ren: Twenty doors. Don't touch any of
them.

13
00:00:36,418 --> 00:00:38,625
Ren: Never take the elevator on day one.

14
00:00:39,295 --> 00:00:43,446
Ren: Three of them. But they cannot see.
They only hear.

15
00:00:44,116 --> 00:00:44,850
Ren: One.

16
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:46,290
Ren: Two.

17
00:00:47,316 --> 00:00:47,886
Ren: Three.

18
00:00:48,916 --> 00:00:53,393
Ren: I swore I would never kill again.
These are not people. Are they?

19
00:00:54,063 --> 00:00:59,406
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part one of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: the van. Follow for part two.

